  "visibleText": "Gemini PRO New chat Connected Apps Connect your favorite apps for smarter help. Learn more From Google Other From Google Google Workspace Get personalized insights from your Workspace apps, and ask for info about your content. Gmail Learn more Google Calendar Learn more Google Docs Learn more Google Drive Learn more Google Keep Learn more Google Tasks Learn more Google Photos Get personalized insights based on your Photos. Find photos of a person, place, moment, and more. Learn more Plan a vacation itinerary for me this winter, inspired by photos of my prior trips. Search services Get personalized insights using your saved data from services like Search, Maps, Shopping, News, and Google Flights and Hotels. You can disconnect this anytime on the Connected Apps page. Your choices here don’t change Gemini’s use of public data. For example, if Search services aren’t connected, Gemini can still use public websites and videos in Search services to respond to you. Learn more Show me hidden patterns in my Google searches YouTube Get personalized insights based on your YouTube data, like video and music recommendations. You can disconnect this anytime on the Connected Apps page. When disconnected, you can still use YouTube to find and get info about public videos. Learn more Recommend a film based on my YouTube history YouTube Music @YouTube Music Play, search, and discover your favorite songs, artists, playlists and more Learn more Play songs where Beyoncé and Jay-Z feature together. Other GitHub @GitHub Import code from public or private repositories, and ask questions about it. Learn more What external libraries are used in the attached code? OpenStax @OpenStax Retrieves passages from openly licensed textbooks from OpenStax. Learn more @OpenStax definition of a Lewis acid OpenTable @OpenTable Discover and book a reservation at the best restaurants for every occasion. Learn more Reserve a table for 2 at La Pecora Bianca SoHo on Friday at 7:30 PM. SynthID 